  <History Date="29-04-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (poor documentation.  auto functions not defined properly and don't make sense - made best guess.  72 channel mode is RGBWAC and 74 channel mode is RGBLemonAC - assumed white and lemon are actually lime...)" Version="0" />
